# SCR-11 · A key file of the person's own: refused whole, taken, read again.
write config/imece/keys gt = G
sh printf 'nonsense here\n' >> config/imece/keys
start
see any key: close
key Escape
type :keys
key Enter
see line 2
sh printf 'gt = G\n' > config/imece/keys
type :keys
key Enter
see keys taken (1)
key ?
see gt
